-- Import results/demographics_bilingual_aggregated.csv as Demographics.
-- Import results/score_summary_bilingual_aggregated.csv as ScoreSummary.
-- Import results/quality_metrics_bilingual.csv as Quality.
-- Measures are independent of the participant-level CSV.
Total Aggregate Count = SUM('Demographics'[n])
Mean Score = AVERAGE('ScoreSummary'[mean])
Group Score Mean = DIVIDE(SUMX('ScoreSummary', 'ScoreSummary'[mean] * 'ScoreSummary'[n]), SUM('ScoreSummary'[n]))
Quality Metric Value = SUM('Quality'[value])
-- IMPORTANT: Total Aggregate Count double-counts if more than ONE demographic dimension is selected.
-- Use dimension_en = "Age group" or another single demographic dimension to count records.
-- Do NOT average different scale codes together: each scale has a different range.
